For \texttt{CATEGORICAL} problems, we use a transformed overlap kernel from~\citep{antBO} as the Gaussian process (GP) kernel function, then maximize the upper confidence bound (UCB) acquisition of GP outputs using EAs to sample candidates in each iteration. 


