% \label{db_b}}
% \hfil
% \caption{Schematic diagram of the decoder block, which adopts the two-stage decoder architecture. (a) Stage A: features are upsampled and refined via transposed convolutions to form a coarse temporal structure; (b) Stage B: additional convolutions with larger dilation factors further refine the upsampled signal.}
