\subsubsection{Mimicry condition}

The \yw{mimicry} guidance is a user-provided time-domain waveform, such as a hummed rendition of the target melody or the melody played on another instrument.
Due to the lack of real-world data for training, we simulate the mimicry guidance by converting the ground-truth MIDI score of the target source to audio using the FluidSynth library~\cite{henningsson2011fluidsynth}. 
