\textbf{Inference:} \yw{Within the EDM framework, the probability flow \minje{ordinary differential equation (ODE)} can be simplified into a nonlinear ODE, allowing the direct use of standard off-the-shelf ODE solvers, such as  high-order Exponential Integrator (EI)-based ODE solvers~\cite{lu2022dpm}, specifically multistep DPM solvers~\cite{lu2022dpm, lu2022dpmpp}, for sampling as in EDMSound.}
