\subsection{Observation Normalization for Increasing Robustness}

% Another improvement that we propose in our paper is to consider a "normalized version" of $\mbx_{ft}$ to compute Eq.~\eqref{eq:new_Levy2}.
We propose to normalize $\mbx_{ft}$ for computing Eq.~\eqref{eq:new_Levy2}.
% Intuitively, 
$\alpha$-stable realizations for $\alpha < 2$ would have outliers that benefit SSL,
