Using GPT-4, we assigned specific contributions to each author, categorizing them as Leadership, Direct Support, or Indirect Support based on predefined criteria. This step involved analyzing the "Author Contribution" field of each paper, which details each author's participation in various research activities such as experimental design, data analysis, manuscript writing, and other key tasks. Using the advanced natural language understanding capabilities of GPT-4, we accurately assigned contributions and categorized roles.

