  \begin{df}\label{zug} \rm Let
\begin{quote} 
 $BSTEP\langle E, F  \rangle =\{\, (a, b)\in C\langle E, F \rangle \times C\langle E, F \rangle \mid \mbox{  there exists  a rewrite rule }
