data. 
Then the time complexity of building  the adjacency-list representation of the dpwpa    $ AUX[ E;  F]  $ is 
$O(|C\langle E\cup F, \emptyset\rangle|+ |A[E; F]| )$.
By Statement \ref{darabsz} and Statement \ref{drrszam}
$|C\langle E\cup F, \emptyset\rangle|\leq |W|\leq n$.
