$\s(a_1, \ldots, a_m) \dot{\rightarrow} a\in R\langle E \cup F, \emptyset\rangle$, 
Algorithm CAD carries out $m$ searches in the red-black tree $RBT3$
and  less than or equal to  $m$ multiplications. 
