In addition to \emph{Fast-DemocraticProcess} (\texttt{Fast}) and \emph{Complex-DemocraticProcess} (\texttt{Complex}), we also analyze $\text{DemocraticProcess}_{C,f}$ with $C=\{|I|\}$ and $f(\ell)=\ell$ (\texttt{Uniform}). This variant resembles a committee election approach and only adds statements addressing all issues.
