\Output{Optimized solution $\mathbf{x}^*$}\
Initialize episode $j=1$, observation dataset $\mathcal{D}_{n,j,0}=\emptyset$, and remaining budget $\Lambda^{\text{tot}}_j=\Lambda$\\
