\end{figure}

To further quantify these trends, we examined acceleration values relative to the distance between vehicles and VRUs. Figure~\ref{fig:accel_distance_scatter} shows that AVs generally began slowing earlier than HDVs, indicating a more defensive posture in managing crosswalk interactions during turning.

