Figure~\ref{fig:violin_headways} compare the distributions of AV and HDV time headways during entry and exit transitions. Entry headways appear similar across vehicle types, reflecting signal or queue constraints. Exit headways show greater separation, with AVs maintaining higher buffers.

\begin{figure}[H]
